    "chunk_text": "e so\u00f0lice fram \u00e6grum & cyse & buteran & fixum & wine forhabban m\u00e6g, he is myceles Se \u00f0e witodlice fram \u00feam, for untrumnesse o\u00f0\u00f0e ahwylcum weorce, forhabban ne m\u00e6g, he bruce, \u00d0\u00e6t hwa fram cyse & meoluce & buteran & \u00e6grum forh\u00e6bbe, & ne f\u00e6ste, is gedwolenlicost & So\u00felice wines & \u00e6lces w\u00e6tan druncennes & galnes synt forbodene, n\u00e6s meoluc & \u00e6gru. Ne cw\u00e6\u00f0 witodlice se apostol, Nellen ge \u00feigcan meoluc & \u00e6gru, ac he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nellen ge beon \u00c6lc Sunnand\u00e6ge on Lencten Cristes lichaman & his blodes haligdomas syndon to onfonne, On \u00feysum eowra f\u00e6stena dagum n\u00e6nige geflitu, n\u00e6nige saca sceolon beon h\u00e6fde, ac on Godes Drihten \u00feurh his witigan \u00f0rea\u00fe \u00fea \u00fee geflitu & saca on Lenctentyde bega\u00fe, & \u00fee wytu fram hyra Efne nu to geflitum & sacum ge f\u00e6sta\u00fe, & ge slea\u00fe of fyste arleaslice. To forh\u00e6bbane is so\u00felice on \u00feysum haligostum dagum fram gem\u00e6ccum, & cl\u00e6nlice & arf\u00e6stlice To myngianne is folc \u00fe\u00e6t hy to \u00f0am \u00feurhhaligum haligdome Drihtnes lichaman & blodes Witodlice swa swa is frecenfullic gehwylcne uncl\u00e6nne to swa m\u00e6rum haligdome geneal\u00e6cean, So\u00felice fram eallum gewisre tide is to gem\u00e6nsumianne, buton \u00f0am swi\u00f0e \u00e6f\u00e6stum & haliglice \u00d0\u00e6t \u00fea m\u00e6ssan \u00f0e g",
